  "question": {
    "text": "In an electromagnetic wave, at an instant and at a particular position, the electric field is along the negative z-axis and magnetic field is along the positive x-axis. Then the direction of propagation of electromagnetic wave is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "positive z-axis",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "positive y-axis",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "&nbsp;at &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>angle from positive &nbsp;y -axis&nbsp;",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "negative y-axis",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Direction of propagation of the electromagnetic wave is along&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p>Thus,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mfenced></math></p><p>Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
